  "description": "Al Nashama is a bold and modern fragrance that blends fruity sweetness with spicy aromatics and a smooth leathery amber base. The scent feels unique, slightly sweet, and sophisticated with a warm Middle Eastern character balanced by fresh elements. The opening introduces a vibrant mix of pink pepper, bergamot, and sage, delivering a fresh, slightly spicy, and aromatic first impression. The heart develops into plum, jasmine, and black pepper, adding a fruity sweetness layered with floral softness and subtle spice. The base settles into saffiano leather, amber, patchouli, and moss, creating a warm, earthy, and slightly leathery finish that feels smooth, rich, and long-lasting. Al Nashama is perfect for those who enjoy fruity-spicy fragrances with a leathery amber depth and a slightly sweet modern twist.",
